Here is yet another attempt to send the Christmas Picture.  Take
this file and strip off everything outside of the double dashed
lines.  If this file is named newspic then type:
	uudecode newspic
This will create a file in the same directory named trainfile.
Then (assuming you are on a vt100 compatible terminal) type:
	cat trainfile
And enjoy.  Whew!

